Error/problem faced

The interface depends on JavaScript callbacks such as:

notebook.select_image

and

notebook.select_video.

Colab widget/JavaScript behavior can fail if callbacks are not registered correctly or if the notebook has not completely initialized.

Resolution

The callback registration and JavaScript selection mechanism were reviewed. The default image and video were explicitly selected using:

select_image('00')

and

select_video('0').

